| 4-5 | Extracts tool name and arguments from the call |
| 9-12 | Validates tool exists in available commands |
| 15-20 | **Permission check** - Security feature! |
| 23-27 | Converts Qwen's argument format to CJ7 format |
| 30-34 | Creates Action object and dispatches execution |
| 37-53 | Handles success/failure results with proper formatting |

### **Return Value Format:**
```json
{
  "success": true/false,
  "output": "result message",    // or
  "error": "error description"
}
```

This code is clean and secure - it properly validates tools, checks permissions before execution, converts argument formats correctly, and provides clear success/error responses for the LLM to interpret.
